==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}}, from {{etyl|ang|en}} {{term/t|ang|ātorcoppe||spider}}, corresponding to {{compound|atter|gloss1=poison, venom|cop|gloss2=head}}. The latter is still to be found in the English word {{term|cobweb|lang=en}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈætəkɒp/}}

===Noun===
